{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows经GPO大规模执行计划任务。对应需求：权限提升。官方：Scheduled Task Execution at Scale via GPO。","index":["logs-system.security*","logs-windows.forwarded*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows经GPO大规模执行计划任务","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows经GPO大规模执行计划任务\n\n### 为何重要\n获取更高权限\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://github.com/atc-project/atc-data/blob/master/docs/Logging_Policies/LP_0025_windows_audit_directory_service_changes.md","https://github.com/atc-project/atc-data/blob/f2bbb51ecf68e2c9f488e3c70dcdd3df51d2a46b/docs/Logging_Policies/LP_0029_windows_audit_detailed_file_share.md","https://labs.f-secure.com/tools/sharpgpoabuse","https://twitter.com/menasec1/status/1106899890377052160","https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/builtin/security/win_gpo_scheduledtasks.yml"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"15a8ba77-1c13-4274-88fe-6bd14133861e","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 权限提升","来源: 默认","对应需求: 权限提升"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"any where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.code in (\"5136\", \"5145\") and\n(\n  (\n    winlog.event_data.AttributeLDAPDisplayName : (\n      \"gPCMachineExtensionNames\",\n      \"gPCUserExtensionNames\"\n    ) and\n    winlog.event_data.AttributeValue : \"*CAB54552-DEEA-4691-817E-ED4A4D1AFC72*\" and\n    winlog.event_data.AttributeValue : \"*AADCED64-746C-4633-A97C-D61349046527*\"\n  ) or\n  (\n    winlog.event_data.ShareName : \"\\\\\\\\*\\\\SYSVOL\" and\n    winlog.event_data.RelativeTargetName : \"*ScheduledTasks.xml\" and\n    winlog.event_data.AccessList:\"*%%4417*\"\n  )\n)\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1053","name":"Scheduled Task/Job","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1053/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1053.005","name":"Scheduled Task","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1053/005/"}]},{"id":"T1484","name":"Domain or Tenant Policy Modification","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1484/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1484.001","name":"Group Policy Modification","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1484/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0004","name":"Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0004/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1570","name":"Lateral Tool Transfer","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1570/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0008","name":"Lateral Movement","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0008/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"from":"now-9m","interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"system","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":217,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
